SKUNKPORT: experimental. Hyprland needs working GLES3 (Mesa with a real GPU driver; softpipe and virgl are
not meant for running it), so build it anywhere but test it on real hardware. The build is very heavy
(C++26, large templates): about 2 GB of RAM per job, so the default is 2 jobs (HDX_JOBS to change).
XWayland, systemd and hyprpm are off, and there is no X11 support at all. Unsupported; may break.
